Should Priests be Lawful Human or Chaotic Elf?

Priests don't have an exciting variety of weapon choices, so the idea
is that I was planning on getting a semi-decent artifact weapon as
soon as possible, to increase their survivability.

Lawful Humans should be able to get Excalibur when they find their
first long sword, and either get basic long sword or Grayswandir as
their first sacrifice gift.  They unfortunately don't get infravision.

Chaotic Elves need to find an elven dagger and an elven broadsword in
order to guarantee Stormbringer as their first sacrifice gift.  And
Stormbringer isn't as exciting as the lawful artifact weapons, but
Elves do get infravision.

Or maybe I should ignore the artifact selections and hope that
minetown has a polearm, which could keep me alive until I get a
unicorn, or something halfway decent?


